{
  "$fixture": "harness-native/rpc/session-commands",
  "provenance": "upstream-source",
  "source": "packages/api/session-controller/src/index.ts (blob f13f24f7), types.ts (blob f03d8d1b)",
  "harnessVersion": "0.1.6-alpha.2",
  "notes": [
    "这四个方法的 wire 参数名都是 'request'。",
    "prompt 的 requestId 是幂等标识：Harness 按 requestId 去重，重试必须复用同一个值。",
    "prompt 的 mode 只有 'queue' 与 'steer'；首版只开放 queue。",
    "prompt 的 content 至少一个非空白 text 或附件，否则在 resolve Agent 之前就被拒。",
    "create 是唯一直接创建 Agent 的操作之一；省略 agentPreset 由 Harness 决定默认值。",
    "cancel 只有会话级语义，没有 turn 级原子条件取消。"
  ],
  "methods": {
    "session/create": {
      "argsKey": "request",
      "request": {
        "type": "client-request",
        "rpcId": "rpc-fixture-0301",
        "method": "session/create",
        "payload": {
          "args": {
            "request": {
              "cwd": "/fixture/workspace/demo-project"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "requestWithIdentity": {
        "type": "client-request",
        "rpcId": "rpc-fixture-0302",
        "method": "session/create",
        "payload": {
          "args": {
            "request": {
              "workspaceId": "workspace-fixture-0001",
              "cwd": "/fixture/workspace/demo-project",
              "sessionId": "session-fixture-0009",
              "agentPreset": "preset-fixture"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "success": {
        "type": "server-response",
        "rpcId": "rpc-fixture-0301",
        "result": {
          "ok": true,
          "value": {
            "sessionId": "session-fixture-0009",
            "agentPreset": "preset-fixture"
          }
        }
      },
      "error": {
        "type": "server-response",
        "rpcId": "rpc-fixture-0301",
        "result": {
          "ok": false,
          "error": {
            "code": "session/conflict",
            "message": "session already exists at a different cwd",
            "details": {
              "sessionId": "session-fixture-0009",
              "requestedCwd": "/fixture/workspace/demo-project",
              "existingCwd": "/fixture/workspace/other-project"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "session/selectModel": {
      "argsKey": "request",
      "request": {
        "type": "client-request",
        "rpcId": "rpc-fixture-0311",
        "method": "session/selectModel",
        "payload": {
          "args": {
            "request": {
              "sessionId": "session-fixture-0001",
              "provider": "provider-fixture-a",
              "model": "model-fixture-1",
              "reasoningEffort": "high"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "success": {
        "type": "server-response",
        "rpcId": "rpc-fixture-0311",
        "result": {
          "ok": true,
          "value": {
            "selected": {
              "provider": "provider-fixture-a",
              "model": "model-fixture-1",
              "reasoningEffort": "high"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "error": {
        "type": "server-response",
        "rpcId": "rpc-fixture-0311",
        "result": {
          "ok": false,
          "error": {
            "code": "session/model-unavailable",
            "message": "requested model route is not routable",
            "details": {
              "provider": "provider-fixture-a",
              "model": "model-fixture-1"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "rules": [
        "provider 是必填项；不能按模型名推断供应商。",
        "reasoningEffort 留空表示不改动档位，不是'某个档位'，不得补成猜测值。",
        "模型不在目录、或档位不在该模型声明的 efforts 里时一律回绝，不回退到默认模型。"
      ]
    },
    "session/prompt": {
      "argsKey": "request",
      "request": {
        "type": "client-request",
        "rpcId": "rpc-fixture-0321",
        "method": "session/prompt",
        "payload": {
          "args": {
            "request": {
              "requestId": "req-fixture-0001",
              "sessionId": "session-fixture-0001",
              "mode": "queue",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "fixture prompt text"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "success": {
        "type": "server-response",
        "rpcId": "rpc-fixture-0321",
        "result": {
          "ok": true,
          "value": {
            "accepted": true
          }
        }
      },
      "error": {
        "type": "server-response",
        "rpcId": "rpc-fixture-0321",
        "result": {
          "ok": false,
          "error": {
            "code": "session/agent-busy",
            "message": "agent cannot accept this prompt now",
            "details": {
              "reason": "fixture reason"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "rules": [
        "accepted=true 只表示上游已接收，不表示生成完成；响应未知不等于未执行。",
        "重试必须复用同一个 requestId；上游按 requestId 去重，返回原始接受结果而不重复插入消息。",
        "不得因超时或重连盲目重发。"
      ]
    },
    "session/cancel": {
      "argsKey": "request",
      "request": {
        "type": "client-request",
        "rpcId": "rpc-fixture-0331",
        "method": "session/cancel",
        "payload": {
          "args": {
            "request": {
              "sessionId": "session-fixture-0001"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "success": {
        "type": "server-response",
        "rpcId": "rpc-fixture-0331",
        "result": {
          "ok": true,
          "value": {
            "accepted": true
          }
        }
      },
      "error": {
        "type": "server-response",
        "rpcId": "rpc-fixture-0331",
        "result": {
          "ok": false,
          "error": {
            "code": "session/writer-held",
            "message": "another writer holds this session",
            "details": {
              "sessionId": "session-fixture-0001"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "rules": [
        "只有会话级 cancel；没有原子条件取消。",
        "中继可加 X-Mimi-Expected-Turn 前置校验，但校验与取消之间仍有竞态，不得宣传为严格 turn 级条件取消。",
        "session/writer-held 在 0.1.5-rc.2 不存在，错误映射必须容忍未知 code。"
      ]
    }
  }
}
